      "description": "A change in typical user behavior has been observed on this device. Suspicious and anomalous user behavior might indicate that a user has been compromised. There have been several alerts associated with the user. Changes to frequency and usage pattern of tools or applications, or the user performing a series of unusual activities might indicate that this device is involved in a possible human-operated attack. "
